# The cot module: raw keys of Cursor on Target XML events that no shared key
# carries on its own, so that an event converted to a CoT XML pack and back is
# unchanged. Written by hand.
module        cot
version       0.1.0
distribution  public
source        "Cursor on Target event schema (MITRE, public release): the attributes of <event>"
key  start_ms  int  ms  "the event's start attribute, epoch milliseconds UTC, as written; time_ms takes the time attribute"
